      "markdown": "# Business context\n\n## About the business\nNorthwind sells analytics software to mid-market retailers.\nIndustry: SaaS\nBusiness model: Annual per-seat subscriptions, billed monthly.\nCustomers: Mid-market retailers in Europe and North America.\nAudience: Finance, customer success and product teams.\n\n## Goals\n- Grow net revenue retention\n- Reduce time to first dashboard\n\n## KPIs\n- **Net revenue**: Gross revenue minus refunds, in USD.\n- **NRR**: Revenue retained from last year, with expansion.\n\n## Glossary\n- **Workspace**: One paying customer account.\n- **Seat**: A named user with a paid licence.\n\n## Reporting conventions\nUSD, UTC, fiscal year starts in February, weeks start on Monday.\n\n## Data caveats\n- Orders before 2024-03 have no region.\n- Test orders have negative ids.\n"
    },
